  "description": "A bird in hand is worth more than 2 in the bush 🐦",
  "body_html": "<p>Happy Monday everyone, hope you and your portfolios are off to a great start. This is a quick note about <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$RTX&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> and <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$KTOS&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>, both defensive sector stocks. Thanks to someone in the chat reminding me that Raytheon has earnings tomorrow. If you are new to my page…I HATE EARNINGS. They are always a coin toss. We consistently see great companies with great earnings….plummet. And vice verse, terrible companies with terrible earnings skyrocket. </p><p>Now to be clear: I have no idea how Raytheon’s earnings will turn out tomorrow. Quarterly they showed some slight declines last quarter. But annually they have been improving. Your crystal ball is as good as mine. </p><p>Here is what we do know:</p><ul><li><p>We are sitting on healthy profits for both. </p></li><li><p>Raytheon is a sector leader (#2). If Raytheon does go down, there is a strong possibility that Kratos will as well. </p></li><li><p>We can always get back in later. There is always something else. </p></li></ul><p>  That all said, I have decided to sell both, ~4% for RTX and ~31% for KTOS. They could go up…I just<em><strong> personally do not like to gamble on earnings</strong></em>. You do what is best for you.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!InH0!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F84194338-9abc-4baa-9782-887b92c275cb_1027x753.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!InH0!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F84194338-9abc-4baa-9782-887b92c275cb_1027x753.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!InH0!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F84194338-9abc-4baa-9782-887b92c275cb_1027x753.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!InH0!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F84194338-9abc-4baa-9782-887b92c275cb_1027x753.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!InH0!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F84194338-9abc-4baa-9782-887b92c275cb_1027x753.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!InH0!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F84194338-9abc-4baa-9782-887b92c275cb_1027x753.png\" width=\"1027\" height=\"753\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/84194338-9abc-4baa-9782-887b92c275cb_1027x753.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:753,&quot;width&quot;:1027,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:123191,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/168870076?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F84194338-9abc-4baa-9782-887b92c275cb_1027x753.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!InH0!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F84194338-9abc-4baa-9782-887b92c275cb_1027x753.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!InH0!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F84194338-9abc-4baa-9782-887b92c275cb_1027x753.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!InH0!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F84194338-9abc-4baa-9782-887b92c275cb_1027x753.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!InH0!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F84194338-9abc-4baa-9782-887b92c275cb_1027x753.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Largest Defense sector stocks. Raytheon is #2 by market cap. Sector leaders, when they plummet, almost always drag the sector followers with them. </figcaption></figure></div><p> I haven’t picked up any new positions this week. I am seeing mostly consolidations and/or pullbacks. As mentioned in my <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/next-stock-market-moves?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Market Gameplan</a>, I am largely just rolling over profits to 1 particular stock…and will continue adding to it (DCA UP!), should the speculation continue to be accurate. As always, if you have questions, feel free to ping me in the chat. </p><p>I’ll keep you updated, and thanks for stopping by! 👍</p><p><em>For more visit: <strong><a href=\"https://www.stocktokdashboard.com/\">StockTokDashboard</a></strong></em> <em><strong>|</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a></strong></em> <em><strong>| <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a></strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to our StockTok Dashboard, updated daily. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a> </strong></em></p><div class=\"captioned-button-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/sold-defensive-bought-boring?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CaptionedButtonToDOM\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">Like StockTok’s content? Consider sharing with a investing friend!</p></div><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/sold-defensive-bought-boring?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/sold-defensive-bought-boring?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p></div>",
